{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00373","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀圜丘乐章 肃和 · 褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀圜丘乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闓阳播气，甄曜垂明。\n有赫圜宰，深仁曲成。\n日丽苍璧，烟开紫营。\n聿遵乾享，式降鸿祯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}